# Exported WLAN profiles. 'netsh wlan export profile ... key=clear' writes the PSK in
# CLEAR TEXT. Both WLAN Profile Refresh and Driver Reinstall export one, and both delete
# it again immediately - but a copy pulled onto a workstation for debugging must never
# reach a commit. This pattern is the backstop.
*.xml

# Fleet results from Get-RemediationResults.ps1. Every row carries a device name and a
# userPrincipalName, so these are personal data, not build output.
*.csv
triage.csv

# dcu-cli and probe logs written under ProgramData; only ever here by accident.
*.log
dcu-scan.log
dcu-apply.log

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
